{"code":"E_VOLUME_NODE_MISMATCH","message":"volume data node does not match the target deployment node","stage":"preflight","deployment_id":"d_01JGOLDEN","suggestion":"Declare a data disposition and retry: --data-restored (rebuilt by the restore flow) or --discard (admin+confirm; the old volume becomes orphaned).","context":{"bound_node":"n_01","target_node":"n_02","volume":"data"},"docs":"https://docs.fleetly.dev/errors/E_VOLUME_NODE_MISMATCH"}